    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n65099" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μάρων</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ωνος</span>, ὁ</span>,
		name of Thracian priest who gave wine to Odysseus, <i><span class="en">
			Od.
			9.197
		</span></i>: hence, of a strong wine, <i><span class="en">
			Cratin.
			135
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			E.
			<u>Cyc.</u>
			412
		</span></i>; perh. also a throw of the dice, cf. <i><span class="en">
			Herod.
			3.25
		</span></i>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάρων</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ονος</span>, ὁ, ἡ, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λευκόψαρος, ὄνοι</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Hippiatr.</u>
				14
			</span></i>.</div>
